  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A luxe, custom foundation brush designed to seamlessly build, buff, and blend with control and ease.<b><br><br>Brush Formulation:</b> Liquid<br><br><b>Brush Coverage:</b> Buildable <br><b><br>Brush Handle Length: </b>3.9\"<b><br><br>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This iconic brush was designed to optimize your foundation performance. The ultra-soft, dense, synthetic bristles seamlessly apply and blur product onto the face for a natural-looking, airbrushed finish while the short, ergonomic, aluminum handle offers control of pressure and application.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Seamlessly buff foundation onto your face in circular motions, starting at the center and working outward.</div></details>",
